--TEST--
the enum in front of a `Core` case is coloured as an enum carrying `defaultLibrary`, and an enum the program declares carries nothing, which only the checker's resolution can tell apart, `rule:ide/semantic-tokens-carry-the-qualifiers`
--FILE--
<?nvs
enum Status: int {
    case Draft = 1;
}
var $state = Status::Draft;
var $verb = Core\Http\Method::Get;
--REQUEST--
semanticTokens types=enum,enumMember
--EXPECT--
2:6+6 enum
3:10+5 enumMember
5:14+6 enum
5:22+5 enumMember
6:13+16 enum defaultLibrary
6:31+3 enumMember
